/ The layout of the preview pads the page by 20px on each side. The box fills
/ the whole width of the device, so -mx-5 takes that padding back and the line
/ breaks here are the ones a phone really shows. The cells stand on the gray
/ of the page More.
.flex.flex-col.gap-5.-mx-5.p-5 class=('bg-canvas' if cell)
  - scenarios.each do |scenario|
    div
      .mb-1.text-xs.font-mono.text-gray-400 class=('px-5' unless cell)
        = scenario[:label]

      - component = PremiumStatus::Component.new(cell:, scenario: scenario[:name], ends_at: scenario[:ends_at])
      = render component
